; EditHelp -- WaveSmith's manual (the Help key, Project > Help...) in
; FS-UAE under MuForce and MuGuardianAngel (DEV:mutools), on PAL hires
; 640x256. The test disk speaks German: the German manual opens
; (DEV:sasc/Help/deutsch/WaveSmith.guide, beside the build); WaveSmith's
; own words stay English (its catalog is not beside the test build).
; DEV:Test/EditHelp.rexx: the page for what is under the pointer, the
; manual's window titled as that page, Project > Help..., Quit closing
; the manual with the window.
;
;   gmake autotest T=EditHelp W=pal LIMIT=300
FailAt 21
Wait 8
Execute DEV:mutools
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/help.trace DEV:Test/Edit/Hilfe.wav DEV:Test/Edit/Hilfe.prl DEV:Test/edit-help-#? ENV:WaveSmith.prefs QUIET
Echo >DEV:Test/auto.log "EditHelp"
Version >>DEV:Test/auto.log DEV:sasc/WaveSmith FULL
Version >>DEV:Test/auto.log LIBS:amigaguide.library
Copy >NIL: DEV:Test/Edit/Single.wav DEV:Test/Edit/Hilfe.wav
SetEnv WaveSmithTrace DEV:Test/help.trace
Run >NIL: DEV:sasc/WaveSmith DEV:Test/Edit/Hilfe.wav
Wait 10
RX DEV:Test/EditHelp.rexx
Wait 3
Echo >>DEV:Test/auto.log "still running:"
Status >>DEV:Test/auto.log COMMAND=DEV:sasc/WaveSmith
Echo >>DEV:Test/auto.log "the trace:"
Type DEV:Test/help.trace >>DEV:Test/auto.log
UnSetEnv WaveSmithTrace
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/Edit/Hilfe.wav DEV:Test/Edit/Hilfe.prl QUIET
Echo >DEV:Test/AutoDone done
